~ p4_after
Emily: It wasn't Mom. It wasn't Dad. It wasn't even an accident. [#thought]
Emily: It was me. [#thought]
Emily: ...I remember now. I... I'm so sorry. [#thought]
do wait(2.0)
Emily: I feel ready. Ready to move on. It's time for me to leave. [#thought]
Emily: I should say bye to mom and dad. [#thought]
=> END